#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "立刻执行"
msgstr "Run now"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "单击下方按钮即可立即运行/停止脚本，支持死循环，但是需要避免空操作，以免造成资源浪费！！"
msgstr "Press the button below to run or stop the script right away. Endless loops are allowed, but avoid no-op iterations so that no resources are wasted."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "启动时执行"
msgstr "Run at boot"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "此脚本在系统启动时自动执行（可选）"
msgstr "This script runs automatically during system startup (optional)."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "按下按钮时执行"
msgstr "Run on button press"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "当前插件会覆盖默认按钮事件，短按按钮执行此脚本（注意：轻按一下快速松开即可，不要超过1秒，否则会重启路由器，超过五秒会重置路由器！！）"
msgstr "This plugin takes over the default button action, so a short press runs this script. Tap and release quickly: holding the button for more than 1 second reboots the router and holding it for more than 5 seconds resets it."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "断网时执行"
msgstr "Run on network loss"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "此脚本在网络断开时执行（可选），此脚本应该注意避免死循环，否则可能会反复创建进程"
msgstr "This script runs when the network goes down (optional). Avoid endless loops here, otherwise processes may pile up."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "定时执行"
msgstr "Run on a schedule"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "此脚本在规定时间内执行（可选），此脚本应该注意避免死循环，否则可能会反复创建进程"
msgstr "This script runs at the configured time (optional). Avoid endless loops here, otherwise processes may pile up."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "温馨提示：#号后面的内容为注释，如果对脚本进行了修改（或首次编辑），请先保存后再运行"
msgstr "Note: everything after a # is a comment. If you changed the script (or edited it for the first time), save it before running."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "温馨提示：保存后此脚本会立即运行一次，而后只会在系统启动初始化阶段运行"
msgstr "Note: after saving, this script runs once immediately and afterwards only during system startup."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "这是一个由用户自由编写 shell 脚本的界面工具，支持立即执行、开机执行、定时执行、断网执行和按下物理按键时执行。"
msgstr "This is a web interface for writing and running your own shell scripts: on demand, at boot, on a schedule, on network loss and on a physical button press."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "启用脚本"
msgstr "Enable script"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "取消时将停用该脚本"
msgstr "Clear this to disable the script"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "时间间隔(秒)"
msgstr "Interval (seconds)"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "您希望多久检测一次网络状态？提示：此值应为 >= 1 的整数"
msgstr "How often should the network state be checked? This must be an integer >= 1."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "分（0~59）"
msgstr "Minute (0-59)"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "时（0~23）"
msgstr "Hour (0-23)"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "日（1~31）"
msgstr "Day (1-31)"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "月（1~12）"
msgstr "Month (1-12)"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "周（1~7）"
msgstr "Day of week (1-7)"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "在以上输入框中，您可以输入指定时间来定时运行脚本。如果不想指定特定值，可以使用 \"*\" 表示\"任何数\"。<br><br>例如：周的值为 \"*\" 表示每周的每天都会执行；\"1,2,3\" 表示周一、周二和周三；\"1-3\" 表示从周一到周三；\"*/30\" 表示每小时的 0 分和 30 分。<br><br>请注意，只有当每个时间条件都满足时，脚本才会执行，并请使用英文输入法输入所有符号。"
msgstr "In the fields above you can enter the time at which the script should run. Use \"*\" for \"any value\". For example, a day of week value of \"*\" runs the script every day, \"1,2,3\" means Monday, Tuesday and Wednesday, \"1-3\" means Monday through Wednesday and \"*/30\" runs at minute 0 and 30 of every hour.<br><br>Note that the script only runs when every time condition matches, and that all symbols have to be typed with an English input method."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "单击下方按钮即可立即运行/停止脚本"
msgstr "Press the button below to run or stop the script right away"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "停止脚本"
msgstr "Stop script"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "执行脚本"
msgstr "Run script"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "脚本已在后台运行。"
msgstr "The script is now running in the background."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "脚本已停止。"
msgstr "The script has been stopped."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "操作失败：%s"
msgstr "Operation failed: %s"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "操作失败，退出码 %d"
msgstr "Operation failed with exit code %d"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "配置已保存，脚本服务已重新启动。"
msgstr "The configuration has been saved and the script service restarted."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/basic.js
msgid "保存失败：%s"
msgstr "Save failed: %s"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/advanced.js
msgid "上传脚本"
msgstr "Upload scripts"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/advanced.js
msgid "支持上传多个脚本以及多个计划任务，在本地编辑后直接上传即可运行，使用此功能时应该避免脚本进入死循环，否则可能引起严重问题。"
msgstr "You can upload several scripts and set up several scheduled tasks. Edit them locally, then upload and run them directly. Avoid endless loops here, otherwise serious problems may occur."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/advanced.js
msgid "上传脚本文件"
msgstr "Upload a script file"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/advanced.js
msgid "计划任务列表"
msgstr "Scheduled tasks"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/advanced.js
msgid "在这里为已上传的脚本安排执行时间，保存后会重建 /etc/crontabs/root 中的相关条目。"
msgstr "Schedule the uploaded scripts here. Saving rebuilds the matching entries in /etc/crontabs/root."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/advanced.js
msgid "计划任务"
msgstr "Scheduled task"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/advanced.js
msgid "脚本名称"
msgstr "Script"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/advanced.js
msgid "-- 请选择 --"
msgstr "-- Please select --"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/advanced.js
msgid "启用/停用"
msgstr "Enable / disable"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/advanced.js
msgid "停用"
msgstr "Disabled"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/advanced.js
msgid "启用"
msgstr "Enabled"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nettask/advanced.js
